    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Dread Talons",
    "summary": "Aura around your **HERETIC ASTARTES** units:\n\n- During the opponent's Command phase, in its Battle-shock step, each enemy unit under its Starting Strength and within 12\" of any of your **HERETIC ASTARTES** units is forced to test for Battle-shock.\n- Battle-shock tests taken by enemy units within 12\" of any of your **HERETIC ASTARTES** units get −1 to the result.\n- An enemy unit this rule has affected need not take further Battle-shock tests that phase.",
